1759	      /* Isochronous IN: drain one payload from the iTD chain pipeline.
1760	       *
1761	       * Ring approach: slot j → itd[j % ISOC_ITD_POOL].  Each iTD is
1762	       * revisited every N*1ms by the controller.  We batch-harvest all
1763	       * completed iTDs (from ring_head forward) in one pass, re-arming
1764	       * each immediately so the controller never runs out of targets.
1765	       *
1766	       * Each DRVR_TRANSFER returns exactly one payload from the FIFO.
