2791	  /* Buffer Page Pointer List (bpl[0..6]) spans 7 physical 4K pages starting
2792	   * at the (page-aligned) base of this iTD's buffer.  ISOC_ITD_BUFSZ (8K)
2793	   * needs at most 3 pages, but program all 7 defensively.  The per-page base
2794	   * must be page-aligned; the per-transaction XOFFS supplies the low 12 bits.
2795	   */
