* Name: sunxi_isoc_harvest
 *
 * Description:
 *   Scan the iTD pool from ring_head forward for completed iTDs.  Each
 *   completed iTD is removed from its frame-list entry, harvested into the
 *   FIFO, and immediately re-armed and re-linked at next_slot.  The
 *   controller never revisits the same iTD.
